        '#defaultUrlRedirect':: d.obj(help='"When none of the specified hostRules match, the request is redirected to a URL specified by defaultUrlRedirect. If defaultUrlRedirect is specified, defaultService or defaultRouteAction must not be set. Structure is documented below."'),
